        "id": 231224,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-06-30T13:36:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was very surprised by this one. Surprised I Minted. Surprised I only lost Haka. Surprised his \"become a 0 HP target\" ability worked against me a few times.</p>\n<p>The only real strategy I employed was \"play nothing, draw cards\". Worked out pretty well. Tempest is really good for controlling the Distractions, at least until the Memo comes out. After Miss Info flipped, I spent a round drawing cards with Ancient Library, then wiped the board with End of Days.&nbsp;<em>Then</em> I started playing cards. :)</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:06:26.460Z",
