        "raw": "<p>I was very surprised by this one. Surprised I Minted. Surprised I only lost Haka. Surprised his \"become a 0 HP target\" ability worked against me a few times.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The only real strategy I employed was \"play nothing, draw cards\". Worked out pretty well. Tempest is really good for controlling the Distractions, at least until the Memo comes out. After Miss Info flipped, I spent a round drawing cards with Ancient Library, then wiped the board with End of Days.&nbsp;<em>Then</em> I started playing cards. :)</p>",
