        "id": 231225,
        "name": "Tyrsis",
        "username": "Tyrsis",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/bc79bd/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-07-03T14:42:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also minted this one despite a few blunders. Mostly applied a similar strategy to Takewalker on the front side, except I had a massive brainfart and killed the first clue which dragged out the pain a little longer than it needed to.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Flesh to Iron is definitely king on the flip side and once she's flipped the game is a bit more forgiving than many other one shots, especially if you've spent the front side largely drawing cards.</p>",
